Subject: [PATCH] NeoForge runtime gaps for intrusive holders, Create, and FD

Keep MappedRegistry intrusive holders across freeze/unfreeze, add Folia-safe
ServerLevel.entityTickList facade, Moonlight ContextAware reload path, extensible
Rarity, FoodProperties.effect(Supplier), Item.modifyDefaultComponentsFrom,
RegistryOps copy ctor, and related FD block/loot APIs.

